OL,3,GNEWSADelay to council shake-up is
OL,4,Ashocking, says MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pause on plans to shake up the
OL,7,Forganisation of local government in
OL,8,FWarwickshire has been called a
OL,9,F"shocking decision" by a
OL,10,FStratford-upon-Avon MP.
OL,12,FSecretary of state for local government
OL,13,FAngela Rayner announced the delay - for
OL,14,Fmultiple areas of England - on Monday,
OL,15,Fto allow for further legal
OL,16,Fconsideration.
