OL,3,GNEWSADelay to council shake-up is
OL,4,Ashocking, says MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FCurrently in Warwickshire there are two
OL,7,Flevels of local government ` county
OL,8,Fcouncil for services such as education
OL,9,Fand social care, and lower tier
OL,10,Fdistrict and borough councils for
OL,11,Fthings like planning and bin
OL,12,Fcollections.
OL,14,FEarlier this year, the government green
OL,15,Flit plans to essentially split the
OL,16,Fcounty into two along a north and south
OL,17,Faxis, with a pair of brand new councils
OL,18,Fcreated, one to run each half. Putting
OL,19,Fthat on hold was creating "further
OL,20,Funcertainty", said MP Manuela
OL,21,FPerteghella.
